B.aeb=s(["30 seconds per question now, up from 15 \u2014 daily quiz, chapter sets and battles.","The question and all four options now fit on one screen, with no scrolling.","The daily quiz banner shows on question 1, then gets out of the way.",u.n,u.d],t.s)
